<%- include('partials/header') %>
<section class="legal-hero"><span class="eyebrow">Legal & trust</span><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>How Ahmedabad Metro handles information used to provide accounts, journey planning, payments, and digital tickets.</p><small>Last updated: 20 August 2026</small></section>
<section class="legal-layout">
  <aside class="legal-summary"><strong>Your privacy at a glance</strong><p>We collect only the information needed to operate your account and deliver purchased tickets.</p><a href="/contact">Ask a privacy question →</a></aside>
  <article class="legal-content">
    <h2>Information we collect</h2><p>We process your name, email address, account credentials, selected stations, booking history, payment references, and ticket validity information. Card and UPI credentials are handled by the payment provider and are not stored by this application.</p>
    <h2>How information is used</h2><p>Your information is used to authenticate your account, calculate fares, complete bookings, generate QR tickets, send ticket emails, show booking history, prevent abuse, and provide support.</p>
    <h2>Sharing and payment services</h2><p>Required booking information may be shared with payment and email delivery providers solely to complete the service you requested. We do not sell personal information.</p>
    <h2>Security and retention</h2><p>Reasonable technical safeguards are used to protect account and ticket data. Records are retained only while needed for service operation, security, legal obligations, and dispute handling.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2><p>You may contact us to request access, correction, or deletion of eligible personal information. Some transaction records may need to be retained where required by law or operational security.</p>
    <h2>Cookies</h2><p>A secure session cookie is used to keep you signed in. It is required for authenticated features and is not used for third-party advertising.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>"><%= supportEmail %></a>.</p>
  </article>
</section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
